+VQA_MODELS="base final991 v6" bash run_e3_eval.sh vqa
+E1_VQA=1 bash run_e3_eval.sh run  # or hook into the full run (gpu0 chain)
+```
+
+`--mock` (with `--mock-acc`) is a deterministic oracle answerer used by the
